DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19484::$$$message_0151_0000_0000$$$::"Huh? Hello, Shirou. What's going on today?[lr]::
19485::$$$message_0151_0000_0001$$$::You didn't tell me that you would be coming to play."[lr]::
19486::$$$message_0151_0000_0002$$$::Illya appears in the salon. I didn't need to call for her.[lr]::
19487::$$$message_0151_0000_0003$$$::Her timing is so perfect, it's like she read my mind.::
19488::$$$message_0151_0001_0000$$$::"Yeah. I don't have an appointment, but I do want to talk.[lr]::
19489::$$$message_0151_0001_0001$$$::Illya, I'd like you to tell me something. No secrets..."[lr]::
19490::$$$message_0151_0001_0002$$$::I cut straight to the point.[lr]::
19491::$$$message_0151_0001_0003$$$::My doubts disappeared as soon as I made this choice.[lr]::
19492::$$$message_0151_0001_0004$$$::I resolve myself and face Illya.::
19493::$$$message_0151_0002_0000$$$::"You'd like me to tell you something...?"[lr]::
19494::$$$message_0151_0002_0001$$$::"Uh... [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Well... [wvl canskip=0 time=500]Um..."[lr]::
19495::$$$message_0151_0002_0002$$$::I completely forgot what I meant to ask her.[lr]::
19496::$$$message_0151_0002_0003$$$::No, I never even had anything concrete in mind.::
19497::$$$message_0151_0003_0000$$$::"That's weird... I'm pretty sure I had something serious to ask you about..."[lr]::
19498::$$$message_0151_0003_0001$$$::"You were thinking about it, but you forgot.[lr]::
19499::$$$message_0151_0003_0002$$$::It's okay. You'll think of it eventually.[lr]::
19500::$$$message_0151_0003_0003$$$::There are days when you sometimes remember things you forgot."::
19501::$$$message_0151_0004_0000$$$::"I...guess. Sorry. I'll remember next time."[lr]::
19502::$$$message_0151_0004_0001$$$::Illya's smile buoys my spirits and scatters my inexplicable anxiety.::
19503::$$$message_0151_0005_0000$$$::"Hey, Shirou.[lr]::
19504::$$$message_0151_0005_0001$$$::You don't look like you have any other plans.[lr]::
19505::$$$message_0151_0005_0002$$$::Let's have tea. Wait, I'll ask Sella to get it ready right away."::
19506::$$$message_0151_0006_0000$$$::"Well, I could join you for tea and conversation..."[lr]::
19507::$$$message_0151_0006_0001$$$::I sit down in a chair, feeling somehow unsatisfied.[lr]::
19508::$$$message_0151_0006_0002$$$::It's still early, but I do get to enjoy a swanky parlor.[lr]::
19509::$$$message_0151_0006_0003$$$::Why not enjoy a cup of afternoon tea?::
§